%[text] 1. Calculate the average brightness in a box **below** the largest cyst: rows 320 to 340, columns 58 to 76. Save it as **below**
%[text] 2. Calculate the average brightness in a box at the same depth **beside** the cysts: rows 320 to 340, columns 20 to 50. Save it as **beside**
%[text] 3. Calculate the ratio below / beside. Save it as **enhancementRatio** \
